          human: 'Zifuli is a 5-player variant of Cöch (Cucco), an Italian partnership trick-taking game from Bergamo. Uses the special 40-card Cucco deck (20 pairs). 8 cards each. Bidding phase determines secret partnerships: bid by naming a card you hold, the holder of the other copy becomes your partner (hidden until card is played). Can bid both copies = play alone. Overcall only by lower card of same suit. Win by capturing more card points (19 total).',
